        <p>wilfully perhaps—but in their anxiety to get to the front they were, perhaps, not taking the time over things as they should do. , Councillor LORD seconded. Upon the amendment being put to the meeting it was lost, only five voting for it. THE COUNCIL AND THE LATE KING OF DENMARK. The DEPUTY-TOWN CLERK read a letter in which the , writer stated he had been directed by the Secretary of ' State to inform the Mayor that his message of condol- .</p>
